{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36906","headline":"送程尊师东游有寄 · 罗隐","name":"送程尊师东游有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华盖峰前拟卜耕，主人无奈又闲行。\n且凭鹤驾寻沧海，又恐犀轩过赤城。\n绦简便应朝右弼，紫旄兼合见东卿。\n劝君莫忘归时节，芝似萤光处处生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}